{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/49af13d24ad8c98df5329eea71b4256d.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/a02b462a2bfb766ddf68c26d9db42fe4.poster.avif?t=1771441027\" width=628 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/a02b462a2bfb766ddf68c26d9db42fe4.webm?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/a02b462a2bfb766ddf68c26d9db42fe4.mp4?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run for your life! There\u2019s a soulless killing machine chasing you! Only one of you can survive, so act quick! Use missiles, landmines, shockwaves, traps, and other kinds of weapons to ensure your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/be4b414ff2ea3ea8777f9ea0d74b240a.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/4cd49cd917941f698e74fe5d8079a4c2.poster.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/4cd49cd917941f698e74fe5d8079a4c2.webm?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/4cd49cd917941f698e74fe5d8079a4c2.mp4?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trouble Dash is a combat racing platformer where you and your friends speed through an obstacle course filled with weapons and interactive environment elements while trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/96861e91cb3b4c2f61bb7cbb3794a5ca.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/9281505db1c72c9f5c4cf9b5c2b38d48.poster.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/9281505db1c72c9f5c4cf9b5c2b38d48.webm?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/9281505db1c72c9f5c4cf9b5c2b38d48.mp4?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally or hop online to show other people what you\u2019re made of. There's co-op  and free-for-all modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/2cf9d3c50e79bacac0738ca7918c804d.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/2c82e1b429c919fa987c7882a3554d17.poster.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/2c82e1b429c919fa987c7882a3554d17.webm?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/2c82e1b429c919fa987c7882a3554d17.mp4?t=1771441027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 upgradable character classes each with unique weapons and  different performance characteristics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win races, collect experience points, and unlock more and more powerful upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/de831696c6552a20a4971fc1a2425a79.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut-throat combat racing</strong> featuring up to <strong>8 players</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of weapons</strong> and other collectables to show them who\u2019s boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive environment</strong> elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrun your demise</strong> and be the one to survive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your appearance</strong> and create your own unique style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and tune your character</strong> for different styles of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single player</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online and local multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op and free-for-all modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numerous tracks</strong> carefully designed with game mechanics in mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature rich level editor</strong> and <strong>level sharing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of achievements</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/fbbfb95aa95d41699d495e006b0a956f.avif?t=1771441027\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t limit yourself to obstacles with basic shapes - the level editor is designed to allow you to create any kinds of obstacles you want. Don\u2019t want to do that? No worries, there still are plenty of  obstacle presets for you to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras/053dbd6f62019ebd87cffdcb10e65a37.avif?t=1771441027\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/extras_big/053dbd6f62019ebd87cffdcb10e65a37.avif?t=1771441027 width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585370?t=1771441027","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/599e0493c197abf7dfaf11821f49f5f905b2f2b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771441027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/a672a2ac858fa87475fd1d19bbd3f705b730b5de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771441027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585370/a672a2ac858fa87475fd1d19bbd3f705b730b5de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771441027","categories":[{"description":"Sing